<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Repository Forked</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #333;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #f0ad4e;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      margin: 15px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #fff;
      background-color: #0275d8;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .details {
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 10px;
      background-color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .details dt {
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .details dd {
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>🍴 Repository Forked</h2>
    <p>Hello Security Team,</p>
    <p>A repository has just been <strong>forked</strong> in Bitbucket:</p>

    <dl class="details">
      <dt>Source Repository:</dt>
      <dd>{{SOURCE_REPO_NAME}} (Project: {{SOURCE_PROJECT_KEY}})</dd>

      <dt>New Fork:</dt>
      <dd>{{FORK_REPO_NAME}} (Project: {{FORK_PROJECT_KEY}})</dd>

      <dt>Forked By:</dt>
      <dd>{{USER_NAME}} &lt;{{USER_EMAIL}}&gt;</dd>

      <dt>Time:</dt>
      <dd>{{TIMESTAMP}}</dd>
    </dl>

    <a href="{{FORK_REPO_LINK}}" class="button" style="color:white">View Forked Repository</a>

    <p>Please verify if this fork is legitimate.</p>

    <p>Thank you,<br></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
